            "sid": "EXO 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niboola eElimu, ewa tsisebele tsiamatsi tsiali ekhumi natsibili, nende emisaala chiamashindu amakhumi musaafu; nibakhomayo ikambi yabwe ahambi nende amatsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.27",
